@prefix kee: <https://w3id.org/kee#> .
@prefix profile: <https://w3id.org/kee/profile#> .
@prefix artifact: <https://w3id.org/kee/artifact#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
# Compatibility note (specification Section 17): this fixture exercises registered
# legacy-readable surfaces (generic https://w3id.org/kee/lifecycle# values and/or
# legacy carriers). It is executable compatibility evidence, not canonical
# new-write guidance; profile-aware migration of lifecycle values is registered
# as unsafe for automatic rewrite (specification Section 9.2 and Section 17).

# Invalid fixture for shacl/artifact-identity-granularity-profile.ttl
# Expected result: does not conform.
# Expected failure: kee:ManagedArtifactUnit instance is a blank node, not an
# IRI, violating the shape's node-level sh:nodeKind sh:IRI constraint. This
# directly encodes the profile's own Candidate Validation Constraint:
# "blank nodes, when used, are not relied upon for cross-system or
# cross-snapshot governance identity" (a recorded project decision).

[]
    a kee:ManagedArtifactUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Invalid managed artifact unit fixture using a blank node identity"@en ;

    kee:artifactType artifact:DocumentArtifact ;
    kee:profileConformance profile:ArtifactIdentityGranularityProfile .
